## yosys synthesis script for gatemate_ising_n16 — workaround B: techmap pass.
##
## WHY: yosys 0.64 synth_gatemate emits CC_LUT1/CC_LUT2/CC_LUT3 for small logic
## functions. nextpnr-himbaechel 0.10 only accepts CC_LUT4.
## FIX: synthesize without writing JSON (keeps design in RTLIL), then apply a
## techmap that upgrades all CC_LUT1/2/3 → CC_LUT4 with don't-care padding.
##
## Usage (from repo root):
##   yosys rtl/gatemate_ising_n16_abc9.ys

read_verilog -sv rtl/gatemate_ising_n16.v
synth_gatemate -top gatemate_ising_n16 -nomx8
techmap -map rtl/lut_upgrade_to_lut4.v
write_json rtl/gatemate_ising_n16_abc9.json
